menu "SSH import / web manager"

    config SSH_IMPORT_POP_DISABLED
        bool "DEV: disable the web-mode proof code (auto-fill it in the page)"
        default n
        help
            Development convenience for WEB (LAN) import mode: the served
            page embeds the session proof code as a hidden prefilled field,
            so no code entry is needed and the stored-profile list loads
            automatically. ANYONE who can open the page can then read,
            add, edit and delete profiles on the deck.

            SoftAP mode is unaffected (there the code is the WPA2
            passphrase and is still needed to join the AP).

            Never ship a build with this enabled.

endmenu
